  (text
    "USB2 native ESP32-C3 interface, not a USB hub. Independent 5.1k Rd on each CC.\nU92 limits shorts at the spring pins; reverse-voltage protection is not a substitute for keyed mating.\nDevice charger EN1/EN2 are both low: USB100 input mode, not the former fixed500mA.\nFull-system current, enumeration, suspend/resume, inrush and USB waveform still require EVT measurements."
    (at 40.64 198.12 0)
